ness_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"iYUwyARgC_RNPA1rTlL3-Q","review_id":"K6evHpnUK-Klh8GO9OLicw","date":"2015-07-06T20:29:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9435129165649414,"text_excerpt":"Holy cow! What an amazing place! We brought some family (who were visiting from Chicago) here for lunch and I can now say this is officially our favorite po-boy place. The sides were delicious. (Try the mac and cheese! It has jalapeños in it!) The potato salad was very good - cold and chunky, the way it should be. I had the shrimp po-boy and it was easily the best shrimp po-boy I've had. You definitely need to check this place out!"},{"business_id":"iYUwyARgC_RNPA1rTlL3-Q","review_id":"KHXRs-0SNXoeSItP8aeYFQ","date":"2012-02-28T16:27:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.940994143486023,"text_excerpt":"I'm no local, but my buddies have been in NOLA for three years, and I shall gladly follow their lead, especially when they suggest the \"best poboy's in the city\" Quick note: Some of the previous reviews have bothered me. As an outsider, feel free to take my opinion with a grain of salt, but... you don't come to Crabby Jack's for the seating, for the ambiance, or for the best service. Sorry if the jambalaya your ordered at a poboy shop wasn't up to snuff. If you have a problem paying $11-12 for a behemoth of a sandwich, your local cafe has all the $7 dainty sandwiches you need. *end rant* My and my friend got the fried green tomato and shrimp remoulade sandwich and the beef brisket and eac..."},{"business_id":"iYUwyARgC_RNPA1rTlL3-Q","review_id":"fHROGlJuwIENP1QGuuCWJA","date":"2008-01-17T07:30:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9401248693466187,"text_excerpt":"This place is a little off the beaten path, especially if you are not a local (or \"loc\" as I like to call them). It is on Jefferson Highway near Oschner Hospital. It is very unassuming from the outside and the parking lot has potholes bigger than some on the city streets but once you get past that you are welcomed to some delicious food at reasonable prices. During my most recent visit, I had the fried green tomato and shrimp romelade po-boy that was full of decent size shrimp and served on very fresh French bread. It was enough to keep me full for quite a while and was only $10 for the larger version (although I am not sure they actually gave me the larger one). My girlfriend had the oys..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"iYUwyARgC_RNPA1rTlL3-Q","photo_id":"pLvRi8N3c6yOh5R36P6C0w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/pLvRi8N3c6yOh5R36P6C0w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8825881481170654},{"business_id":"iYUwyARgC_RNPA1rTlL3-Q","photo_id":"Mizl1kMXZv0Nhz-o7OBziQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Mizl1kMXZv0Nhz-o7OBziQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8468037843704224},{"business_id":"iYUwyARgC_RNPA1rTlL3-Q","photo_id":"QEviPXv-JOmaQ1lICXHMeg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/QEviPXv-JOmaQ1lICXHMeg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8404131531715393},{"business_id":"iYUwyARgC_RNPA1rTlL3-Q","photo_id":"-df1bccGnPnlYmhR49nDUA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-df1bccGnPnlYmhR49nDUA.jpg","visual_re